menu "ADS1015 Configuration"

    config ADS1015_HIGH_THRESH
        int "ADS1015 HIGH THRESH"
        default 100
        help
            High threshold for ADS1015 current sensing.

    config ADS1015_LOW_THRESH
        int "ADS1015 LOW THRESH"
        default -100
        help
            Low threshold for ADS1015 current sensing.

    config ADS1015_TRIP_SAMPLES
        int "Samples in a row past a threshold to stop the motors"
        range 1 100
        default 3
        help
            One input must read past the high or low threshold this many
            times in a row before the motors stop, so a single noisy sample
            does not stop them. The two inputs take turns: at 3300 SPS
            (ADS1015) each is read about every 0.6 ms, at 475 SPS (ADS1115)
            about every 4 ms.

endmenu
